<title>ECUADOR: ECUADOR COCOA AND COCOA PRODUCTS EXPORT PRICES.</title>
<headline>ECUADOR COCOA AND COCOA PRODUCTS EXPORT PRICES.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the</p>
<p>minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36</p>
<p>kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective</p>
<p>from August 7 to August 13 the 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 63.63</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 67.77</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 69.67</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 73.17</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$170.29</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$127.72</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 95.15</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 24.70</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.47</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 27.25</p>
</text>
